## Command 2: LLM Gateway Query

Command:
```bash
AGY_LLM_GATEWAY_URL="$(ht-resource url gemini-subscription)" AGY_LLM_GATEWAY_API_KEY="$HT_RESOURCE_TOKEN" ~/.local/bin/agy -p 'What is 6 times 7? Answer with the number only.' --model gemini-3.8-flash --output-format json --print-timeout 180s
```

